    "Description": "A color photograph taken inside the Pullen Park Carousel house of a lion, 2 horses, a pig, a chariot, and a giraffe. From left to right: the head of a giraffe; part of the red seated chariot; a cream horse with a black mane, knees and muzzle that has a gold trimmed red harness; a brown horse with a cream muzzle; the head of a pig; and a yellow lion with a brown mane that has a gold wing harness. The ground is dirt, sand, and mulch.\n\nReverse is white with gold text reading \"Kodak-Official Sponsor of the Olympic Games\" with the Olympic rings and \"Kodak Royal Paper.\" Black printed text reads \"<No.11A>515 21-2 NNNNN+28AU 0141.\"",
